  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mental Health and Psychosocial Support Surge Mechanism (MHPSS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Surge Mechanism is a programme that aims to increase understanding, coordination and better integration of MHPSS in emergency  response. To achieve this the project rapidly deploys MHPSS experts at the request of cooperating humanitarian organisations in disaster, violence, conflict and/or refugee/migration-related crises.

With the September 2025 top-up during the remaining 16 months additional deployments can be realized, but also efforts will be intensified to also build capacity and effect deployments in conflict settings and protracted crises, with a focus on MHPSS and peacebuilding, across the H(D)P nexus. 

Proposal (offerte): MINBUZA-2025.2532483 230002651 informeel ingediende offerte RVO optopping MHPSS Surge mechanisme	10-09-2025 at 17:03</narrative>
  </description>
